      <h2>About Zanzibar Butterfly (Park)</h2>
      <div>Zanzibar Butterfly Centre near Jozani Forest is a community-based conservation project breeding native butterfly species for biodiversity protection and environmental education. The walk-through aviary showcases the complete lifecycle from egg to caterpillar to chrysalis to adult butterfly, with species like the African Monarch, Citrus Swallowtail, and Zanzibar's endemic butterflies. The project supports local farmers through butterfly farming income and funds conservation education in schools. A unique ecological experience complementing Jozani Forest visits.</div>
